✗ Windows blocked the sign-in

Windows 11 24H2 does not allow guest sign-in to a shared folder any more. It
also insists on signed connections.

1. On the sharing PC, use a Devpit share. It has a real user name and password.
2. Or type the user name and password of an account on the other PC.
3. Do not turn off SMB signing to work around this. It protects your files.

errno 1272

